\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_minimal_set_mvp_for_sil_4 Minimal Set (MVP for SIL 4)
```
Required absolute minimum:
1. Safety Plan (01)
2. SRS (05)
3. HARA (06)
4. Architecture Design (09)
5. Code Review Report (15)
6. Static Analysis Report (16)
7. Unit Test Report (19)
8. Traceability Matrix (12)
9. Safety Case (22)
10. RteFramework Verification (24)
```

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_standard_set_recommended Standard Set (Recommended)
```
Add to minimal set:
- V&V Plan (02)
- SafeRS (07)
- RteFramework Integration (08)
- Detailed Design (10)
- OSAdapter Design (11)
- Test Plan (18)
- Integration Test Report (20)
- Coverage Analysis (21)
- Deviation Management (25)
```

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_complete_set_belt_suspenders Complete Set (Belt & Suspenders)
```
All documents (01-29)
Needed for large/critical systems or complex RTOS OSAdapters
```

