\section platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_review_approval_workflow Review & Approval Workflow

Each document should follow this workflow:

```
1. DRAFT
   Author writes initial version
   Self-review for completeness
   
2. TECHNICAL REVIEW
   Peer review by technical team
   Review for technical accuracy
   Comments and revisions
   
3. SAFETY REVIEW
   Functional Safety Manager reviews
   Checks compliance with Safety Plan
   Verifies traceability
   
4. MANAGEMENT REVIEW
   Project Manager sign-off
   Ensures resources are allocated
   
5. APPROVED
   Document placed under change control
   Baseline established
   No changes without Change Request
   
6. RELEASED TO NOTIFIED BODY
   Submitted as part of assessment package
```

---

\section platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_document_control_template Document Control Template

Each document should include:

```markdown
---
Document ID: [Project]-[Number]-[YY.MM]
Title: [Document Name]
Revision: [A/B/C/...]
Date: [Date]
Status: [DRAFT / REVIEW / APPROVED / RELEASED]
Author: [Name]
Reviewed By: [Name]
Approved By: [Name, Safety Manager]

Change History:
| Rev | Date | Author | Change |
|-----|------|--------|--------|
| A | 2026-08-01 | [Name] | Initial draft |
| B | 2026-08-15 | [Name] | Incorporated review comments |

---
[Content]
```

