\section platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_success_criteria_for_each_phase Success Criteria for Each Phase

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_planning_phase Planning Phase ✓
- [ ] Safety Plan approved by Functional Safety Manager
- [ ] V&V approach defined and realistic
- [ ] Tool strategy documented

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_requirements_phase Requirements Phase ✓
- [ ] SRS complete and reviewed
- [ ] HARA identifies all critical failure modes
- [ ] Safety requirements derived and traced
- [ ] RteFramework integration approach documented

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_design_phase Design Phase ✓
- [ ] Architecture reviewed and approved
- [ ] Design traceability established
- [ ] Design review findings resolved
- [ ] No traceability gaps

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_implementation_phase Implementation Phase ✓
- [ ] Code review 100% complete (all files reviewed)
- [ ] Static analysis passed (MISRA compliance verified)
- [ ] Test coverage >90% (SIL 4 target)
- [ ] All tests passing

\subsection platformrte_docs_templates_00_DOCUMENT_CHECKLIST_assessment_phase Assessment Phase ✓
- [ ] Safety Case complete and compelling
- [ ] All deviations documented and justified
- [ ] Notified Body assessment scheduled
- [ ] Assessment findings resolved
- [ ] Certificate received

